  "species_order": ["grazer", "shoal", "minnow", "cleaner", "glowfin"],
  "species_note": "The animals (aquatic-r2: data, not code). species_order is the order they are built and ticked in (their ids, animals and seeded draws follow it, so a species added at the end leaves the earlier ones as they were). Per species: name (the group, for the HUD), one (a single animal), count, zone (its niche), home (a shelter id, 3 m above it, or a position), wander, speed, flee_speed, flee_reach, health; flees: always (prey that flees any fish near) or foe (only once it is a foe); hide_from_lancer: the reach (m) at which it hides at home from a hunting lancer; signals_to_friend, signal_reach and signal_gap (s): it is befriended by that many spaced calls, and a bite makes it a foe; follow_leash: as a friend it follows the fish in its own zone while the fish is this near its home; warn_reach: a friend this near flashes a warning when the lancer investigates; meal and respawn (s): the energy a kill gives and its return time (default the fish food's energy and regrow); station {reach, rest_speed, heal_per_s}: as a friend, a fish resting (slower than rest_speed) this near the species' home is tended and healed while one of its animals lives (a \"cleaned\" event once a visit), and the animals swim to it; lured {reach, leash, speed}: a fish whose sense is the lure draws the species' animals to its head from this near while it stays within leash of their home (they stop fleeing it). aquatic-r2 added minnow (the jaw lineage's first food, in the shallows), cleaner (befriended on the reef, a cleaning station) and glowfin (deep prey only a lure brings near).",
